<body>
    <h1>Multi-Firm User Discovery Guardian Capital</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <h1 id=3D"MultiFirmUserDiscoveryGuardianCapital-BusinessStructure">=
Business Structure</h1>
<p><img class=3D"drawio-diagram-image" width=3D"468" style=3D"width:951px;m=
ax-width: 100%;" src=3D"7e08047b3e8c8b95776502dd68c10de01cd8c27cb820e6ba127=
52f84067e7a06" height=3D"192"></p>
<p><br></p>
<p><br></p>
<h1 id=3D"MultiFirmUserDiscoveryGuardianCapital-FirmUsageToday">Firm Usage =
Today</h1>
<ul style=3D"list-style-type: square;">
 <li data-uuid=3D"d09aa977-06f8-43c6-a1c5-828f5072f9d6">CX / R2 / NR / SZ c=
onfiguration for those firms</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"6f893122-1b01-402c-adf0-395651bd3ea4">User setups - are t=
he duplicates, etc.</li>
</ul>
<p><br></p>
<h1 id=3D"MultiFirmUserDiscoveryGuardianCapital-HistoricalFeedback&amp;Obse=
rvations">Historical Feedback &amp; Observations</h1>
<ul style=3D"list-style-type: square;">
 <li data-uuid=3D"0c39f544-d743-4f60-b75c-9139e6e6e86f">Questions from them=
 on transition, etc.</li>
</ul>
<p><br></p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
 <table class=3D"relative-table wrapped confluenceTable" style=3D"width: 49=
.2237%;">
  <colgroup>
   <col style=3D"width: 12.7195%;">
   <col style=3D"width: 30.4525%;">
   <col style=3D"width: 56.8199%;">
  </colgroup>
  <tbody>
   <tr>
    <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Date</th>
    <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">JIRA</th>
    <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Inquiry</th>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">December 2026</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">NCS-15663</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Requested the details of the sub-advisor fun=
ctionality compared to non-sub-advisor access</td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">January 2026&nbsp;</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">NCS-15778</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"0fed1d0e-0259-4b25-8bd0-823fc4bf8410">Recently inqui=
red if they could bulk upload new user requests instead of the SSO entering=
 one at a time.</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"376b3083-b75b-4d8b-85dc-42d91e9fb6e4">Requested a us=
er access report for all systems to do a thorough review of all user ID's a=
nd permissions across both firm ID's</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"8da2e37d-5cae-4285-ab44-aa40feddb111">Have indicated=
 the reports provided can be confusing and difficult to understand</li>
     </ul></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">February 2026</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">NCS-16296 / NCS-16223</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>User Access workflow:</p>
     <p>Three elite firms (Guardian, Newport and Westcourt) have reported i=
ssues with the My Request function in legacy Compass. When an SSO creates a=
 ticket, it stays in their queue until the SSO amends this.&nbsp;</p>
     <p>As the SSO is an approved requester and can do so for themselves an=
d behalf of other employees, it doesn=E2=80=99t really make sense to have t=
hese tickets stay with them, and they should go straight to user access.</p=
>
     <p>For non-SSO users requesting changes, then it should remain with th=
ese requests needing to be approved by the SSO.</p></td>
   </tr>
  </tbody>
 </table>
</div>
<h1 id=3D"MultiFirmUserDiscoveryGuardianCapital-EngagementFindings">Engagem=
ent Findings</h1>
<p>June 9, 2026&nbsp;</p>
<p>Sergio Di Vito - Vice President Operations</p>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"62496a06-c890-4ff8-b59c-fdbf7fc44777">Sub- Advisors are n=
ot granted access to all, view only by RR code.&nbsp; One trader has access=
 to trading (user: KIERAN JEEVES at Fiera)</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"04afd2dc-930a-4c96-8f1f-0f6db3d6f842">Finds having to hav=
e 2 user ID's is a nuisance (sergio.divito1 and sergio.divito2)</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"cf98d654-dfa6-44d4-97aa-97c3c0abcc1b">would prefer to hav=
e one ID with the ability to view accounts or generate reporting by firm co=
de - currently is getting consolidated reporting&nbsp;</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"3b0e7b6c-b4da-4970-8132-ab1c41e6a63e">only needs access t=
o both firm codes for oversight&nbsp;</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"725174f1-6498-425d-b231-f84712490a7f">Reports he isn't ab=
le to view IFM accounts with his current access - note: he has access to th=
e RR code as a subadvisor in R2 for both user ID's</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"68592381-ad76-42d9-b5b7-1735c3efa72d">Finds there are too=
 many user ID's and passwords</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"b70e269a-fecf-491c-9283-bc9ca09a04c0">Is unsure if he has=
 been receiving quarterly attestation report</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"65f0dfaa-68f3-497b-a97b-8260bf8b4709">the SFTP file notif=
ication does not indicate what report is available, would be helpful if it =
was clear what report is delivered by SFTP</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"7a480e3c-b625-49df-be36-7f9ffc77175a">would like a cash p=
rojection report</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"9f933930-9f55-45c3-a5fe-a7fb68c78a10">would like the abil=
ity to run cash balance reports by RR code</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"f2cb2ff6-35fb-4a0a-8d61-0049d8abe291">Needs a consolidate=
d view of user access for oversight and management</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"239f4462-da43-4e6f-b9f2-9129c76fb9ca">Rejection emails ar=
e directed to wrong email address or group</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"22700bd5-3be4-44c2-980e-f32760a0a8d9">Finds the user acce=
ss workflow problematic (see JIRA: NCS-16296 / NCS-16223)</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"d189aa49-197f-43ad-9d16-5be1c1f6fea5">Relationship with a=
 US subadvisor that uses SWIFT for trade settlements&nbsp;</li>
</ul>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
